Flow: TryCloseLoop/LinkScans emit raw scans, actual inserted edge IDs,
candidate chains and covariance through G02_*_EVIDENCE environment paths.
Input/output contracts and upstream pin: README.md in this directory.
Caveats: no acceptance/physics changes; not installed into /opt/ros or products.
Fresh native mapper execution with this promoted patch is unconfirmed.

